<title>USA: Itron expects profit in second half of '97.</title>
<headline>Itron expects profit in second half of '97.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itron Inc said it expects the second half of 1997 to show a very marked improvement, including a return to profitability.</p>
<p>It said it expects financial results for the first and second quarters of 1997 to be similar to those of the third and fourth quarters of 1996 with possible relative improvement in the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Itron Wednesday reported a net loss of $2.3 million or $0.17 a share for the fourth quarter.</p>
